    <div class="fc"><div class="fi">📊</div><div class="ft">ICAO Risk Matrix</div><div class="fd">Visual 5×5 ICAO SMS Risk Matrix (Probability × Severity) — automatically plots flight position.</div><span class="fb fb-o">ICAO Doc 9859</span></div>
    <div class="fc"><div class="fi">🔮</div><div class="ft">Predictive Analytics</div><div class="fd">AI-based risk prediction with trend analysis, confidence level, and risk trajectory.</div><span class="fb fb-b">AI Engine</span></div>
